msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/documentation/use/manage-profile.md:9
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"![Screenshot shows user profile "
"settings](/screenshots/cypress/user-profile.cy.js/user-profile-settings-full.png)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
