#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:107
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Use a reverse proxy like Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM). It has a GUI that "
"provides an easy [Letsencrypt](https://letsencrypt.org/) integration."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:107
#, markdown-text
msgid "Use a cloudflare tunnel, which provides SSL termination."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/get-started/installation/docker.md:109
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Both scenarios are covered in the separate [Docker Compose "
"Scenarios](/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios) page."
