msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:8
#: src/en/reference/es-indexed-attributes.md:25
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/intro.md:158
#: src/en/reference/rest-api/knowledgebase.md:19
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:14
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If the \"vanilla\" Zammad stack doesn't cover your use-case, you can use one "
"of the pre-defined scenarios. We don't recommend to change the compose files "
"locally, because it will be hard to keep track of upstream changes for the "
"stack then. This is why you should either use Portainer's repository build "
"method or clone the repository and update it regularly, when using docker "
"compose."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:16
#, markdown-text
msgid "The following scenarios are supported and explained further below:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[Making the stack available via "
"HTTPS](#making-the-stack-available-via-https)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Add a Cloudflare tunnel service to the stack"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Add a Nginx Proxy Manager (NPM) to the stack"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Add an external docker network to Nginx"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "[Using external services](#using-external-services)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Disable Elasticsearch service"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"[Making services externally "
"available](#making-services-externally-available)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Add an external docker network to Elasticsearch"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '  - '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
#, markdown-text
msgid "Add an host port to Elasticsearch"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/reference/docker-compose-scenarios.md:28
