#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:24
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "General Limitations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:29
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"There are some general limitations which you can find below. There could "
"also be limitations, depending from which system you are coming. These are "
"covered in the specific sections."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:31
#, markdown-text
msgid "General limitations for all migrations:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
#, markdown-text
msgid "Migrations are only possible on new instances."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Migrations are only possible from one source. Several migration sources on "
"one instance are not supported."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
#, markdown-text
msgid "Zammad can't migrate object types it doesn't know, migrations will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:38
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Zammad migrates all or nothing. This means that you can't deselect specific "
"information specific groups, tickets or users."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:39
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Specific Migration Guides"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (info Missing a migration source?)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"If your system it not mentioned yet, you'll have two options. You can "
"either\n"
"use Zammad's powerful API or drop our\n"
"[sales team a message](https://zammad.com/en/company/contact){target=_blank} "
"for a custom\n"
"development or even migrator sponsoring.\n"
"\n"
"Migrations are available for hosted setups too! Contact support for "
"further\n"
"information!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:52
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Freshdesk"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:58 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:203
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Please note Freshdesk specific limitations below. These are additional "
"limitations to the general ones listed."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:69 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:218
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:525
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Differential migrations are not supported! The general suggestion is to run "
"a test import before to learn how long the migration will take."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:69
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Important: Please note that migration speed highly depends on your Freshdesk "
"plan (API rate limits apply)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:69
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Due to API limitations, Zammad will not show the total number of objects to "
"import, but instead correct them in steps of 100."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:69
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Your Freshdesk plan has to provide API support. This may not apply to all "
"available plans."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:69 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:218
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"User passwords are not migrated and will require the user to use the "
"password reset link on Zammad's login page."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:76
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Zammad requires API access which is why you'll need to [create an API "
"key](https://support.freshdesk.com/support/solutions/articles/215517-how-to-find-your-api-key){target=_blank} "
"for the migration. The migrator will request your Freshdesk subdomain and "
"API key."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:77 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:533
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Ensure to retrieve the API key with a full administrator account. Less\n"
"privileged users will end in a broken migration.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:82 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:229
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:434 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:538
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Import"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:87 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:234
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:543
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"In general, you have two options on how to migrate data. If you have a "
"fairly big instance with a lot of data, you may want to consider using the "
"console over the browser version."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Via Browser\n"
"\n"
"After installing Zammad and\n"
"[configuring your webserver](./webserver-config), navigate to your\n"
"Zammads FQDN in your browser and follow the migration wizard. You can find\n"
"it in the log in screen by clicking the \"Or migrate from another system\"\n"
"link at the bottom.\n"
"\n"
"Depending on the number of users, tickets and Freshdesk plan this may take "
"a\n"
"while.\n"
"\n"
"Seeing the message \"_Interrupted by scheduler restart. Please restart "
"manually\n"
"or wait till next execution time._\"?\n"
"\n"
"If this message appears after providing your credentials, please be "
"patient.\n"
"The migration should start within 5 minutes.\n"
"\n"
"If you receive above message after the migration begun, please consider "
"using\n"
"the console approach instead and reset the installation.\n"
"\n"
"=== Via Console\n"
"\n"
"Open console:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"zammad run rails c\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Set variables:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"subdomain = '{freshdesk subdomain}.freshdesk.com'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"token = '{freshdesk token}'\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Update Zammad settings for freshdesk import:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint', \"https://#{subdomain}/api/v2\")\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"Setting.set('import_freshdesk_endpoint_key', token)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"Setting.set('import_backend', 'freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"Setting.set('import_mode', true)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Check your configuration in a dry run:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"Sequencer.process('Import::Freshdesk::ConnectionTest')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Run the migration:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"job = ImportJob.create(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"AsyncImportJob.perform_later(job)\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs|tip)
#: src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:88 src/en/tutorials/migrate.md:544
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"Want to see the progress of the migration?\n"
"\n"
"Use\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"pp ImportJob.find_by(name: 'Import::Freshdesk')\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"which gives you an output of the current state of the job.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

