msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:104
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Adjusting the Webserver Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (warning)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure to never use HTTP connections - we encourage you to use HTTPS!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:112
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 - Get a Current Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:116
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Copy & overwrite the default ``zammad.conf``. Adjust your Nginx config "
"directory according to your setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:117
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"cp /opt/zammad/contrib/nginx/zammad_ssl.conf "
"/etc/nginx/sites-available/zammad.conf\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:121
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:124
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:204
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Adjust the just copied file with a text editor of your choice (e.g. vi or "
"nano)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:127
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Locate any ``server_name`` directive and adjust ``example.com`` to the "
"domain of your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:130
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:210
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Now you'll need to adjust the path and file names for your ssl certificates "
"you obtained. Adjust the following directives to match your setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
#, markdown-text
msgid "``ssl_certificate`` (your ssl certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
#, markdown-text
msgid "``ssl_certificate_key`` (the certificates private key)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:134
#, markdown-text
msgid "``ssl_trusted_certificate`` (the public CA certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:138
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If you don't have a ``dhparam.pem`` file yet, you can easily adapt the "
"example below to generate this file. You can find the correct path in your "
"webserver config. Search for ``ssl_dhparam``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:139
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:219
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"openssl dhparam -out <path>/dhparam.pem 4096\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:144
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Adjust HTTPS Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:150
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:230
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Our default configuration aims for a broad support of end user devices. This "
"may not fit your needs. Mozilla has a great [ssl-config "
"generator](https://ssl-config.mozilla.org/){target=_blank} that should help "
"you to meet your requirements!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:151
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4 - Save & Reload"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:155
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Reload your nginx with ``systemctl reload nginx`` to apply your "
"configuration changes."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:158
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:276
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"After that, you should be greeted by our getting started wizard.  Go on with "
"the [first steps in Zammad](/en/tutorials/first-steps)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:159
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Apache"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:161
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 1 - Enable Module"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:165
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Zammad requires a module (``a2enmod``) which is not enabled by "
"default. CentOS users have to adjust a config file because this module is "
"not available there."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:166
#, no-wrap
msgid "a2enmod proxy proxy_html proxy_http proxy_wstunnel headers ssl\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (details Config for CentOS)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:174
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Add/uncomment the appropriate ``LoadModule`` statements in your Apache "
"config\n"
"in ``/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf``:\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"LoadModule headers_module modules/mod_headers.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_module modules/mod_proxy.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_html_module modules/mod_proxy_html.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_http_module modules/mod_proxy_http.so\n"
"LoadModule proxy_wstunnel_module modules/mod_proxy_wstunnel.so\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Restart your webserver after saving the configuration.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:190
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 2 - Get a Current Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:194
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"The package installation copied a ``zammad.conf`` file to your webserver "
"config directory. Check if it is present and do not rename this file!"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:196
#, markdown-text
msgid "Adjust your Apache config directory according to your setup:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (sh)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:197
#, no-wrap
msgid "ls /etc/apache2/sites-available\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:201
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 3 - Adjust the Config File"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:207
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Locate any ``ServerName`` directive and adjust ``example.com`` to the domain "
"of your Zammad instance."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:214
#, markdown-text
msgid "``SSLCertificateFile`` (your ssl certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:214
#, markdown-text
msgid "``SSLCertificateKeyFile``(the certificates private key)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:214
#, markdown-text
msgid "``SSLCertificateChainFile`` (the public CA certificate)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:218
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"If you don't have a ``dhparam.pem`` file yet, you can easily adapt the "
"example below to generate this file. You can find the correct path in your "
"webserver config. Search for ``SSLOpenSSLConfCmd DHParameters``."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:224
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 4 - Adjust HTTPS Configuration"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:231
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 5 - Enable the Site"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:235
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"This step mostly depends on your selected folders and should only affect "
"``sites-available`` folders."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced div block (tabs)
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:236
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\n"
"=== Ubuntu, Debian, OpenSUSE\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/apache2/apache2.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"a2ensite zammad\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"=== CentOS\n"
"\n"
"Make sure the following line is present in your Apache config\n"
"(`/etc/httpd/conf/httpd.conf`):\n"
"\n"
"```apache\n"
"IncludeOptional sites-enabled/*.conf\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"Enable it:\n"
"\n"
"```sh\n"
"ln -s /etc/httpd/sites-available/zammad_ssl.conf /etc/httpd/sites-enabled/\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ####
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:270
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Step 6 - Save & Reload"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: src/en/tutorials/webserver-config.md:274
#, markdown-text
msgid ""
"Reload your apache with ``systemctl reload apache2`` to apply your "
"configuration changes."
msgstr ""
